## 🚀 Deployment Guide — Step by Step

### STEP 1 — Upload files to GitHub

1. Go to: **https://github.com/ramachandra1975/ramachandra**
2. Click **"Add file"** → **"Upload files"**
3. Upload both files:
   - `index.html`
   - `_config.yml`
4. Scroll down → click **"Commit changes"**

---

### STEP 2 — Enable GitHub Pages

1. In the repo, click **"Settings"** (top menu)
2. Scroll down to **"Pages"** (left sidebar)
3. Under **"Source"** → select **"Deploy from a branch"**
4. Branch: **main** / Folder: **/ (root)**
5. Click **"Save"**

Your site will be live at:  
👉 **https://ramachandra1975.github.io/ramachandra**

---

### STEP 3 — Point your domain www.culturalmusings.com

In your domain registrar (GoDaddy / Namecheap / Google Domains etc.):

**Add these DNS records:**

| Type  | Name | Value |
|-------|------|-------|
| CNAME | www  | ramachandra1975.github.io |
| A     | @    | 185.199.108.153 |
| A     | @    | 185.199.109.153 |
| A     | @    | 185.199.110.153 |
| A     | @    | 185.199.111.153 |

**Then in GitHub Pages settings:**
- Under "Custom domain" → type: `www.culturalmusings.com`
- Check **"Enforce HTTPS"**

DNS changes take 24–48 hours to propagate.

